Description: Provides an interface from R to 'OptimLib'
    <https://optimlib.readthedocs.io/>, a lightweight header-only C++
    library of numerical optimization methods for nonlinear functions,
    including BFGS, L-BFGS, conjugate gradient, gradient descent,
    Nelder-Mead, differential evolution and particle swarm optimization,
    built on the 'Armadillo' linear algebra library. The 'OptimLib' header
    files (generated in header-only mode) are shipped with this package so
    that other R packages can use them by including 'RcppOptimLib' in the
    'LinkingTo' field of their 'DESCRIPTION' file. Example programs
    demonstrate minimizing C++ objective functions as well as plain R
    functions via callbacks, using 'Rcpp' and 'RcppArmadillo'.
